    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game where the goal is to survive the horde of !(*%$(!#. They have risen from the belly of the earth and she is ready to defile and devour. She controls by having machines that take over the nervous and skeletal systems of the host. They become a walking husk, lifeless and unrecognizable.  !(*%$(!# lifted the lockdown to expand its army beyond the !@!@. Your plan is to survive and infiltrate its birthplace to stop this great evil, but who knows if you even can...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fight the horde through multiple stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fight against the clock; it gets harder by the minute\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Get stronger within and outside each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unlock new weapons and features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unlock new stages and modes</p>",
